cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "EpitoScope" in publications use:'
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
title: 'EpitoScope: Interactive QC, Visualization, and Immunogenicity Assessment of
  Immunopeptidomics Data'
version: 1.0.0
abstract: An interactive R/Shiny application that unifies quality control, visualization,
  comparative statistics, and MHC class I/II binding prediction for mass-spectrometry-based
  immunopeptidomics data. It ingests search-engine outputs from PEAKS, FragPipe, DIA-NN,
  and Spectronaut through a configurable column-mapping layer, and provides publication-ready
  figure export and relational storage of processed results and binding predictions.
authors:
